      "value": "If they would test for modified clients at start and or runtime and prevent a login it would help a lot. I think steam does that on some games. Modded files in the gamefolder are replaced once you start the game. Boom no more modded clients. Everyone runs the exact same version. If an update gets rolled out you get a message if you are online and have to reconnect within a given ammount of time.",
